//　率直なところ、不思議である。
  He looks unsure of how to answer.

  The reason I've asked whether times are tough for his family is because I do not believe it to be true. If I did, the question would merely be a self-serving show of pity.

  Haya, while hardly plump, does not appear at all malnourished. His siblings, too, seemed in good health.

  It doesn't fit.

